<h1>Seen a cabin you like? We'll draw it and price it.</h1>
<p><img src="https://ideaswood.eu/wp-content/uploads/price-my-cabin-sketch-to-garden-cabin-scaled.jpg" alt="Sketch to garden cabin" width="2048" style="width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px" /></p>
<p>Send us a photo from Pinterest, a magazine, a neighbour's garden — or a quick sketch on paper. We draw the building to your size and price it — <strong>free, no obligation</strong>.</p>
<p>IdeasWood is the manufacturer. We make and supply the building; your request is handled together with the nearest IdeasWood partner for your area.</p>
<h3>How it works</h3>
<p><img src="https://ideaswood.eu/wp-content/uploads/price-my-cabin-sketch-to-ideasplanner-scaled.jpg" alt="A pencil sketch of a garden cabin next to a laptop showing the same cabin designed in IdeasPlanner" style="width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px" /></p>
<ol>
<li><strong>Tell us what you have in mind</strong> — a photo link, rough size, and what you'll use it for (garden room, sauna, guest house, storage).</li>
<li><strong>We draw it</strong> — to your size, with the windows, doors and terrace you want.</li>
<li><strong>You get a price</strong> — for the building, plus delivery to your address.</li>
</ol>
<p>Not sure yet? Browse real prices first: <a href="https://ideaswood.eu/product-category/garden-cabins/">garden cabins</a>, <a href="https://ideaswood.eu/product-category/sauna/outdoor-sauna/">outdoor saunas</a>, <a href="https://ideaswood.eu/product-category/summer-houses-chalets/">summer houses</a>, <a href="https://ideaswood.eu/product-category/insulated-wooden-houses/">year-round wooden houses</a>.</p>
<p><em>What's included: the building itself (kit). Foundations, assembly, electrics, plumbing and building permits are arranged locally and are not part of our price.</em></p>
<h3>Send us your idea</h3>
<p>Attach a photo, a sketch or a PDF — or just describe what you have in mind. You can also email it to <a href="mailto:info@ideaswood.eu">info@ideaswood.eu</a>.</p>
